    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "KOLOTEX\nSheer Relief\nSHEER SUPPORT PANTIHOSE\nExtra\nlarge size\nhas extra panel\nfor extra\ncomfort.\nAsk the Oantas girls about Sheer Relief. They give all the\nsupport a girl on her feet needs. With a glamour she can't be without.\nSheer Relief is definitely sheerer than any other support pantihose. Yet the\npower yarn construction (seven times the elasticity of stretch nylon) give\nyou maximum comfort and cling all day long.\nThey outlast pair after pair of ordinary pantihose. Get the same\nkind of good-looking comfort a Qantas girl needs. And Sheer Relief now\nincorporates a cotton gusset made from soft natural cotton that actually\nbreathes for greater coolness and comfort - more absorbency, too. Made\nfrom 30% Lycra and 70% specially imported nylon.\nWASHING INSTRUCTIONS:\nHand wash in warm water using mild soap. Drip dry in\nshade. Do not iron. Keep separate from other garments when wet as\ncross staining may occur.\nWEIGHT (Ib) kg\n(110)\n(121)\n(132)\n(143)\n(154)\n(165)\nB\n9 310259117680\nNEW SHEER\nRELIEF\nC/GREY AVERAGE\n642\nAVERAOR\nE\nF\nG\n70% Nylon; 30% Lycra®\n- QANTAS Photography courtesy of Qantas.\nMade in Australia by Kolotex Glo Australia Pty. Ltd.\n22 George Street, Leichhardt.\nLycra® is the registered name of Du Pont's Elastane Fibre.",
      "AVERAGE\nCLASSIC GREY\nKOLOTEX\nSheer Relief\nSHEER SUPPORT PANTIHOSE\nMake your legs\nlook as good as\nthey'll make them feel.\nDANTAS"
    ],
